boot: stzos init -- machine makeen_qemu (hosted / aarch64 / qemu_virt) -- pid 1
boot: console /dev/ttyAMA0
boot: mount proc at /proc -- done
boot: mount sysfs at /sys -- done
boot: mount devtmpfs at /dev -- done
boot: mount ext4 at /data -- done
boot: grant process (effectful)
boot: grant filesystem (effectful)
boot: refuse gpio (effectful)
boot: start kds -- pid N -- /stzr /app/kds.luau
kds: the kitchen display world is up on the Makeen box (aarch64, stzr under PID 1)
kds: read /etc/machine -- 7 declarations rode in the image
boot: kds (pid N) exited 0
boot: start poste -- pid N -- /stzr /app/poste.luau
poste: the counter world is up on the Makeen box, after kds
poste: /data is the box's persistent partition, mounted by PID 1 before any world spoke
boot: poste (pid N) exited 0
boot: every service has ended -- init has nothing left to keep alive
boot: init halts the machine -- reboot(RESTART)
reboot: Restarting system
